WEBVTT

00:01:19.570 --> 00:01:26.080
<i>On the first day of the world,</i> <i>under the Tree of Life,</i>

00:01:26.080 --> 00:01:32.250
<i>the two of us heard the voices of whales,</i> <i>reverberating from afar.</i>

00:01:32.250 --> 00:01:38.760
<i>With all that we have lost,</i> <i>and all that we have loved</i>

00:01:38.760 --> 00:01:45.430
<i>embraced in our arms,</i> <i>where will we wander off to now?</i>

00:01:45.430 --> 00:01:51.770
<i>The answer lies in the amber sun.</i>

00:01:51.770 --> 00:01:58.110
<i>If I had never met you,</i>
<i>I would have been a destroying angel.</i>

00:01:58.110 --> 00:02:03.790
<i>My soul possessed of</i> <i>a twinkling of immortality,</i>

00:02:03.790 --> 00:02:07.460
<i>do not wound my wings.</i>

00:02:07.460 --> 00:02:14.130
<i>I was born to know this feeling.</i>

00:02:14.130 --> 00:02:20.470
<i>For ten thousand years</i> <i>and two thousand more, I've loved you.</i>

00:02:20.470 --> 00:02:26.810
<i>After eight thousand years,</i>
<i>I loved you even more.</i>

00:02:26.810 --> 00:02:33.150
<i>For another hundred million years</i> <i>and two thousand more, I'll still love you.</i>

00:02:33.150 --> 00:02:41.650
<i>From the first day I knew you,</i> <i>the music in my hell has never stopped.</i>

00:02:50.400 --> 00:02:53.670
Its composition is 80% carbon,

00:02:53.670 --> 00:02:57.140
and 10% organic compounds containing oxygen.

00:02:57.140 --> 00:02:59.240
In other words, amber.

00:02:59.240 --> 00:03:02.840
There is no evidence of the feather having been placed inside.

00:03:02.840 --> 00:03:06.610
We believe the amber formed around the feather at its center.

00:03:06.610 --> 00:03:10.450
Are you saying it belonged to a winged dinosaur?

00:03:10.450 --> 00:03:12.520
The dates are too far apart.

00:03:12.520 --> 00:03:19.530
Carbon dating has established the amber as being from roughly 12,000 years ago.

00:03:19.530 --> 00:03:24.370
12,000 years?!
Amber is fossilized tree resin!

00:03:24.370 --> 00:03:27.600
It couldn't have formed in that span of time.

00:03:27.600 --> 00:03:29.590
Are you sure you haven't miscalculated?

00:03:30.610 --> 00:03:35.040
A single feather sealed in amber...

00:03:35.040 --> 00:03:41.380
It is to be delivered to Solar Wing in order to end the war.

00:03:41.380 --> 00:03:47.460
Chapter 6, verse 4, "The Mystery Song" from the Book of Holy Genesis.

00:03:47.460 --> 00:03:52.090
It could change the complexion of the war.

00:03:52.090 --> 00:03:54.220
I thought you said it was a "miscalculation"?

00:03:56.100 --> 00:04:02.040
If it has to do with the Shadow Angels, it is incumbent upon us to analyze it.

00:04:02.040 --> 00:04:07.030
We must take the wishes from 12,000 years ago very seriously.

00:04:34.470 --> 00:04:37.270
It's our precious day off.

00:04:37.270 --> 00:04:39.710
Are you going to waste it squatting there all day?

00:04:39.710 --> 00:04:40.770
Can't I?

00:04:42.240 --> 00:04:44.280
Well, yes, but...

00:04:44.280 --> 00:04:46.810
I really want to get promoted...

00:04:46.810 --> 00:04:49.520
How'd your semester finals go?

00:04:49.520 --> 00:04:50.680
Miserable.

00:04:56.290 --> 00:04:59.630
Say, they're performing the ballet "Giselle." Want to go?

00:05:00.700 --> 00:05:06.170
Giselle is the story of a miserable woman taken advantage of by an egotistical-

00:05:06.170 --> 00:05:08.440
That kills all the fun.

00:05:08.440 --> 00:05:11.140
Kills? It's my misfortune.

00:05:11.140 --> 00:05:13.630
No, Reika, you're not like that all.

00:05:18.050 --> 00:05:21.920
When you're with me, you'll meet misfortune, as well.

00:05:21.920 --> 00:05:27.320
If you'd let me, I'd embrace you with all my heart, misfortune or not!

00:05:34.900 --> 00:05:39.330
What would you like for your birthday?

00:05:39.330 --> 00:05:41.670
My birthday? That's still far off.

00:05:45.240 --> 00:05:46.570
How about this?

00:05:48.680 --> 00:05:50.010
Could it be an incense burner?

00:05:51.850 --> 00:05:56.340
That's a flea trap that 18th century women hung under their skirts.

00:05:58.690 --> 00:06:00.690
T-Then...

00:06:00.690 --> 00:06:01.880
how about this?

00:06:03.190 --> 00:06:04.350
Silvia.

00:06:08.300 --> 00:06:09.290
Forgive me.

00:06:11.130 --> 00:06:12.460
You dropped your guard!

00:06:17.840 --> 00:06:21.310
Apollo! Stop it! Not here!

00:06:21.310 --> 00:06:23.980
He said he never lets his guard down!

00:06:23.980 --> 00:06:28.050
Brother! You don't have to take a guy like this seriously!

00:06:28.050 --> 00:06:30.040
True, it was childish.

00:06:31.050 --> 00:06:32.590
What?

00:06:32.590 --> 00:06:34.250
I'm at least partly adult!

00:06:39.890 --> 00:06:41.060
See?

00:06:51.170 --> 00:06:55.340
The Barrier Field Generator...
It's the neatest thing!

00:06:55.340 --> 00:06:59.680
It uses the same basic system as in other cities,

00:06:59.680 --> 00:07:02.420
but it's output is totally superior.

00:07:02.420 --> 00:07:03.750
Did you know that?

00:07:03.750 --> 00:07:07.590
The Barrier Field depends on the geologic strata.

00:07:08.590 --> 00:07:10.930
Here, it's especially strong.

00:07:10.930 --> 00:07:13.930
That's why it was chosen as the site for Deava Base.

00:07:13.930 --> 00:07:15.930
Oh, so you knew?

00:07:15.930 --> 00:07:16.920
Naturally!

00:07:21.540 --> 00:07:22.530
What's this?!

00:07:47.300 --> 00:07:51.290
<i>Those wingless bastards.</i>
<i>They've broken the seal?</i>

00:07:54.270 --> 00:07:58.810
You're saying our feather has fallen into the hands of the wingless ones?

00:07:58.810 --> 00:08:01.980
That is correct, Lord Johannes.

00:08:01.980 --> 00:08:05.350
What hopes were invested in that feather?

00:08:05.350 --> 00:08:07.150
There is no record.

00:08:07.150 --> 00:08:10.380
However, it came from Atlandia.

00:08:10.380 --> 00:08:14.820
We must assume it contained important information.

00:08:14.820 --> 00:08:18.430
Lord Johannes, give us your permission to get it back.

00:08:18.430 --> 00:08:24.030
It could be a trap by the wingless ones to lure us out.

00:08:24.030 --> 00:08:29.530
Toma, are you planning to barge into Solar Wing's lair yourself?

00:08:30.870 --> 00:08:34.680
Moroha, then you would permit the wingless ones'...

00:08:34.680 --> 00:08:37.670
...filthy hands to fondle our feather?

00:08:41.350 --> 00:08:43.950
That is not what Moroha meant.

00:08:43.950 --> 00:08:49.020
Under no circumstances should they defile what is ours.

00:08:49.020 --> 00:08:52.590
But if it is located in such an insolent location as Deava,

00:08:52.590 --> 00:08:54.930
how will we break through the Barrier Field?

00:08:56.100 --> 00:08:58.190
I have a plan.

00:09:12.350 --> 00:09:14.870
Can't you hear it?

00:09:18.620 --> 00:09:21.060
The Tree of Life...

00:09:21.060 --> 00:09:23.560
Remember...

00:09:23.560 --> 00:09:24.890
Right alongside...

00:09:26.560 --> 00:09:31.730
The Tree of Life...
The Genesis of the world...

00:09:33.730 --> 00:09:34.720
Rena!

00:09:36.370 --> 00:09:37.710
Call the medical team!

00:09:37.710 --> 00:09:38.700
Right!

00:09:40.210 --> 00:09:41.240
Commander!

00:09:41.240 --> 00:09:43.440
Its effects on the human body are unknown.

00:09:44.610 --> 00:09:46.580
Such inexperience...

00:09:46.580 --> 00:09:48.480
Announce this to everyone:

00:09:48.480 --> 00:09:51.790
Anyone who touches this feather will be punished severely.

00:09:51.790 --> 00:09:52.920
Why?

00:09:52.920 --> 00:09:55.750
Don't have questions. Answer them!

00:10:02.430 --> 00:10:03.420
Brother?

00:10:04.670 --> 00:10:06.930
Brother! Is something wrong?

00:10:06.930 --> 00:10:08.670
Don't come in!

00:10:08.670 --> 00:10:10.160
Don't come near me!

00:10:20.780 --> 00:10:23.250
You mustn't come near me.

00:10:23.250 --> 00:10:24.910
Something dreadful is...

00:10:36.700 --> 00:10:38.190
Don't come near me!

00:10:39.400 --> 00:10:40.390
Brother!

00:10:49.810 --> 00:10:50.970
You're not yourself.

00:10:53.380 --> 00:10:55.820
You're not yourself, all right.

00:10:55.820 --> 00:10:57.820
Normally, you'd slug me.

00:10:57.820 --> 00:11:00.150
Your Amazonian strength is all you've got.

00:11:06.330 --> 00:11:07.320
Apollo!

00:11:10.770 --> 00:11:11.760
Fool!

00:11:12.830 --> 00:11:14.830
That's a bit more like you.

00:11:24.880 --> 00:11:27.350
Don't you want to see that feather?

00:11:29.480 --> 00:11:32.350
Fudo said not to,

00:11:32.350 --> 00:11:34.850
but doesn't that make you want to touch it?

00:11:38.490 --> 00:11:41.360
There might be something written about Baron.

00:11:42.360 --> 00:11:45.200
Baron, Baron... always Baron!

00:11:48.170 --> 00:11:51.200
He's the only person
I could call a friend.

00:12:10.390 --> 00:12:15.730
<i>A fruit is tastiest immediately</i> <i>before it rots.</i>

00:12:15.730 --> 00:12:16.790
Toma...

00:12:18.730 --> 00:12:21.230
We are ready to launch our attack.

00:12:23.400 --> 00:12:27.400
You must wish to meet him again... your dear friend.

00:12:30.580 --> 00:12:34.520
I am going to meet someone dear to me, as well.

00:12:34.520 --> 00:12:36.180
Very dear.

00:12:45.990 --> 00:12:50.760
Have you ever told anyone you loved them?

00:12:54.870 --> 00:12:56.770
Have you, Commander?

00:12:56.770 --> 00:12:57.760
I have.

00:12:59.110 --> 00:13:00.270
I see.

00:13:13.950 --> 00:13:15.120
Forgive me.

00:13:16.790 --> 00:13:20.280
Your feelings dissolved in the tea did not want to be drunk.

00:13:25.800 --> 00:13:30.640
Women, for all eternity, will be something men cannot understand.

00:13:35.810 --> 00:13:39.140
Just mice. We'll let them go.

00:14:25.360 --> 00:14:26.350
Wait.

00:14:29.400 --> 00:14:31.200
I can smell something here.

00:14:31.200 --> 00:14:34.870
You can smell the infrared ray ions?

00:14:34.870 --> 00:14:39.530
Ions? What's that?
All I know is they stink.

00:15:11.840 --> 00:15:13.770
I've smelled this scent somewhere before.

00:15:13.770 --> 00:15:14.780
Where?

00:15:14.780 --> 00:15:16.640
I was just about to recall.

00:15:25.150 --> 00:15:26.750
Apollo! Get ahold of yourself!

00:15:26.750 --> 00:15:27.740
Apollo!

00:15:32.760 --> 00:15:34.920
The one with clipped wings...

00:16:04.430 --> 00:16:07.060
That day...

00:16:07.060 --> 00:16:09.960
I called your name.

00:16:09.960 --> 00:16:12.800
And you...

00:16:12.800 --> 00:16:14.790
...Called yours.

00:16:21.080 --> 00:16:22.880
Apollonius.

00:16:22.880 --> 00:16:24.070
Seliane...

00:16:27.950 --> 00:16:33.150
If only I had not met you...

00:16:33.150 --> 00:16:36.990
If only we never met...

00:16:36.990 --> 00:16:41.660
If we never met, I could have remained a killer angel.

00:17:03.380 --> 00:17:06.020
The misfortune of meeting.

00:17:06.020 --> 00:17:08.680
And the happiness of meeting.

00:17:12.130 --> 00:17:13.290
Seliane...

00:17:15.300 --> 00:17:16.630
Apollonius...

00:17:27.710 --> 00:17:33.710
I fell in love with you... a human.

00:17:33.710 --> 00:17:39.710
I fell in love with you... a Shadow Angel.

00:17:52.200 --> 00:17:53.570
Apollonius...

00:17:58.340 --> 00:18:01.330
I've been ordered to execute you.

00:18:03.880 --> 00:18:06.400
Then kill me.

00:18:07.410 --> 00:18:08.580
Why?

00:18:14.760 --> 00:18:15.920
Why?

00:18:20.030 --> 00:18:25.770
Apollonius, I've brought a foolish wingless one who attempted to save you.

00:18:25.770 --> 00:18:27.600
Seliane!

00:18:27.600 --> 00:18:30.100
Apollonius...

00:18:30.100 --> 00:18:36.940
Curse your own powerlessness to save the life of the one you love.

00:18:36.940 --> 00:18:38.280
Stop it!

00:18:41.920 --> 00:18:48.290
If I spare the wingless one, will you return to me?

00:19:04.810 --> 00:19:10.970
Moroha, would you mind leaving her life in my hands?

00:19:12.150 --> 00:19:14.480
I won't beg for my life to a Shadow Angel!

00:19:15.820 --> 00:19:18.150
Then you shall have what you want!

00:19:29.000 --> 00:19:30.160
Apollonius!

00:19:31.330 --> 00:19:34.170
You love her that much?!

00:19:34.170 --> 00:19:35.830
That much?!

00:19:38.840 --> 00:19:42.010
And then, we fought...

00:19:42.010 --> 00:19:44.500
Together, against the Shadow Angels.

00:19:59.190 --> 00:20:00.350
Seliane...

00:20:01.530 --> 00:20:02.860
Apollonius...

00:20:22.720 --> 00:20:26.050
What's the big idea?! That's gross!

00:20:26.050 --> 00:20:28.220
Well, same here!

00:20:36.400 --> 00:20:38.400
Do you remember what happened?

00:20:38.400 --> 00:20:41.570
Just vaguely.

00:20:41.570 --> 00:20:43.560
In our previous lives, we...

00:20:46.710 --> 00:20:50.740
Enemy attack!
All elements report to Command Center!

00:21:00.750 --> 00:21:03.390
I've come to see you,

00:21:03.390 --> 00:21:05.260
Solar Wing.

00:21:38.790 --> 00:21:40.630
Silvia! Pierre!

00:21:40.630 --> 00:21:43.290
Fire Fist!

00:23:43.650 --> 00:23:49.590
<i>From 12,000 years of suffering</i> <i>come quiet signs of ruin.</i>

00:23:49.590 --> 00:23:55.430
<i>Next on</i> Aquarion: "The 12,000-Year-Old Love Letter"!

00:23:55.430 --> 00:23:57.490
<i>It's sort of nice...</i>
